# Redo Log File Multiplexing
---To multiplex redo log files for better fault tolerance.

## Commands Used
---sql

SELECT group#, member FROM v$logfile;

ALTER DATABASE ADD LOGFILE MEMBER '/u02/app/oracle/oradata/THRONE/redo01b.log' TO GROUP 1;
ALTER DATABASE ADD LOGFILE MEMBER '/u02/app/oracle/oradata/THRONE/redo02b.log' TO GROUP 2;
ALTER DATABASE ADD LOGFILE MEMBER '/u02/app/oracle/oradata/THRONE/redo03b.log' TO GROUP 3;

SELECT group#, member FROM v$logfile;



